#| msgid "Here's how to calculate an expectation value while using error mitigation and suppression in Qiskit Runtime. We can make use of precisely the same circuit and observable as before, but this time keeping the optimization level fixed at level 2, and now tuning the _resilience_ or the error mitigation technique(s) being used. This error mitigation process occurs multiple times throughout an optimization loop.\n"
